      "output": {
        "stdout": "=== n=81 | How about a woman character for my avatar?\n    @c1 syntax.clause form=fragment modifier=\"How\"\n    @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"about\" from=$c1 to=$n1\n    @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"woman\" head=\"character\"\n    @r2 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$n1 to=$n2\n    @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"avatar\"\n=== n=82 | Maybe the female figure would be better for my avatar.\n    @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative modifier=\"Maybe\" auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"be\" modifier=\"better\" subject=$n1\n    @n1 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" dependent=\"female\" head=\"figure\"\n    @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$c1 to=$n2\n    @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"avatar\"\n=== n=83 | I think I'd like a woman as my avatar.\n    @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n    @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"think\" subject=$n1\n    @n2 syntax.nominal head=\"I\"\n    @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"'d\" verb=\"like\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n    @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" head=\"woman\"\n    @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"as\" from=$n3 to=$n4\n    @n4 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"avatar\"\n    @r2 syntax.relation from=$c1 to=$c2\n=== n=85 | It would be nice if my avatar were the woman.\n    @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"It\"\n    @c1 syntax.clause form=declarative auxiliary=\"would\" verb=\"be\" modifier=\"nice\" subject=$n1\n    @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"if\" from=$c1 to=$c2\n    @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"my\" head=\"avatar\"\n    @c2 syntax.clause form=declarative verb=\"were\" subject=$n2 complement=$n3\n    @n3 syntax.nominal dependent=\"the\" head=\"woman\"\n=== n=86 | Give me a woman figure for the avatar.\n    @c1 syntax.clause form=imperative verb=\"Give\" complement=$n1 complement=$n2\n    @n1 syntax.nominal head=\"me\"\n    @n2 syntax.nominal dependent=\"a\" dependent=\"woman\" head=\"figure\"\n    @r1 syntax.relation marker=\"for\" from=$n2 to=$n3